## Goal

A unit on the field stops drawing the seven keywords that do nothing there: Equip, Tradable, Cloaked, Crater, Flashback, Stack and Temporary.

- **The flag.** `KeywordVisual` gets an `onField` flag. Every entry of the total `KEYWORD_VISUALS` map must set it, so a new keyword must set it too.
- **What a hidden kind loses.** An `onField: false` kind gets no treatment, so it takes no layer slot and no `AMBIENT_MAX` loop. It gets no visible chip and does not count in the `+n`.
- **What it keeps.** Its `.keyword[data-keyword]` span stays in the DOM with `data-chip="hidden"`. The hover preview and the inspect sheet still list every keyword.
- **Paperwork.** A new ruling, R2577000, amends R438 and has tests named after it. A pending fragment claims `visual`.

